Abstract = {Social media growth all around the world brought benefits and challenges
   to society. One problem that must be highlighted is hate speech
   proliferation on the Internet. This article proposes a technique to hate
   speech detection in texts, which uses a Cross-Lingual Learning
   classifier. In our experiments, we used a public dataset in Portuguese
   and achieved one of the greatest F1 Scores within our state-of-the-art.
   Besides, this work is the first one to perform a cross-lingual learning
   task for hate speech detection using a corpus in Portuguese.},
