Abstract = {We present the results and the main findings of SemEval-2020 Task 12 on
   Multilingual Offensive Language Identification in Social Media
   (OffensEval-2020). The task included three subtasks corresponding to the
   hierarchical taxonomy of the OLID schema from OffensEval-2019, and it
   was offered in five languages: Arabic, Danish, English, Greek, and
   Turkish. OffensEval-2020 was one of the most popular tasks at
   SemEval-2020, attracting a large number of participants across all
   subtasks and languages: a total of 528 teams signed up to participate in
   the task, 145 teams submitted official runs on the test data, and 70
   teams submitted system description papers.},
